@OpenInternetFan @Tesla That's one thing a lot of people forget.

Some of us "Influencers??? (Don't consider myself that, but the other are for sure) have the Camera Button (Self-Driving Snapshot Button) that sends the data directly to Tesla AI.

This new 14.2 Lite release fixes A TON of the braking events, the phantom breaking is still a thing at night, but isn't a thing in the day. Although it does seem they have decreased in severity. I make sure to report all of those issues directly to Tesla and my reviews of FSD versions.

@Jason asks @JensenHuang the one question many of us wanted to know:
Jason: "Will you have the hands down best Open Source model"
Jensen: "We will build it because one, we can (we have the skills to do it), and because our customers need us to do it" 
